  <issue>
  shutdown should cancel open orders
## Proposal

When stopping the bot (via ctrl+c, `/stop`) open orders are kept open and will be filled by the exchange "whenever" the market is ready to.
This can be dangerous should the bot be stopped due to a sudden market crash

A proper shutdown should allow the following (configurable!):

- [ ] cancel unfilled open orders
- [ ] force-close all open orders

Comments, suggestions, Pullrequests in this regard are welcome :wink:
  </issue>
  
